WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.745
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:47.015 --> 01:51.778
[Episode 9]

3
02:06.752 --> 02:08.673
I'll draw Zhou Yang.

4
02:28.393 --> 02:30.192
Or maybe I'll draw you.

5
02:30.192 --> 02:31.873
You love this sofa bed so much.

6
02:31.873 --> 02:33.992
You don't even want to sleep with me.

7
03:14.512 --> 03:16.352
Your right hand is seriously injured.

8
03:16.352 --> 03:17.912
There might be permanent aftereffects.

9
03:17.912 --> 03:19.593
It will affect your daily life.

10
03:19.593 --> 03:21.833
Please be mentally prepared.

11
04:22.760 --> 04:24.120
What's wrong?

12
04:24.120 --> 04:25.760
What are you doing?

13
04:26.432 --> 04:29.953
Oh. I... I'm just cleaning up.

14
04:37.400 --> 04:39.039
Why are you crying?

15
04:43.150 --> 04:44.280
Oh.

16
04:44.280 --> 04:47.152
Maybe I slept too much this afternoon.

17
04:47.152 --> 04:48.752
I'm fine.

18
04:57.960 --> 04:59.561
It hurts?

19
05:02.320 --> 05:04.680
The injury on my hand is probably still recovering.

20
05:04.680 --> 05:06.391
It'll be fine once it heals.

21
05:06.391 --> 05:09.393
It doesn't matter if it never fully heals.

22
05:09.393 --> 05:12.232
At worst, I'll just stop painting.

23
05:12.232 --> 05:14.073
I'll find another job then.

24
05:14.073 --> 05:16.992
Like insurance or sales.

25
05:16.992 --> 05:19.232
Maybe I'll even make more money.

26
05:19.232 --> 05:21.032
You can't hold a brush?

27
05:25.872 --> 05:27.472
Yeah.

28
05:48.232 --> 05:50.225
I'm here for you.

29
05:50.225 --> 05:51.525
Yeah.

30
05:54.120 --> 05:55.999
Don't worry.

31
05:56.792 --> 05:59.073
I'll be okay.

32
06:04.320 --> 06:06.513
Don't worry.

33
06:16.312 --> 06:17.753
Keep it up, Shen Mo.

34
06:17.753 --> 06:19.912
You can do this.

35
06:19.912 --> 06:22.393
I can't be a burden to Zhou Yang.

36
06:23.432 --> 06:25.112
You can do this.

37
06:31.633 --> 06:33.513
- Hello. - And you are?

38
06:33.513 --> 06:35.912
I'm the one who contacted you online.

39
06:35.912 --> 06:38.033
I'm here to apply for the art teacher job.

40
06:38.033 --> 06:39.753
Did you bring your resume?

41
06:42.013 --> 06:43.528
[Resume] [Shen Mo]

42
06:48.080 --> 06:49.200
Shen Mo.

43
06:49.200 --> 06:50.640
Your resume is very impressive.

44
06:50.640 --> 06:52.213
Not at all.

45
06:52.213 --> 06:54.113
Have you been training since you were a kid?

46
06:54.113 --> 06:55.673
I've been painting since I was little.

47
06:55.673 --> 06:58.033
I've also been working part-time since I started college.

48
06:58.033 --> 07:00.273
So, I have quite a bit of experience.

49
07:00.273 --> 07:02.272
Please take a look at my works.

50
07:08.273 --> 07:09.513
Wow.

51
07:09.513 --> 07:10.872
These are really good.

52
07:10.872 --> 07:12.593
You're professionally trained and draw so well.

53
07:12.593 --> 07:16.286
Say, what brought you to my small studio?

54
07:16.286 --> 07:18.926
I haven't had a job since I graduated.

55
07:18.926 --> 07:21.967
My partner has been supporting me.

56
07:21.967 --> 07:24.127
He works from dawn to dusk.

57
07:24.127 --> 07:25.246
I feel bad for him.

58
07:25.246 --> 07:28.280
I want to... help share his burden.

59
07:28.280 --> 07:29.926
I see.

60
07:29.926 --> 07:31.567
But the pay here isn't high.

61
07:31.567 --> 07:33.207
Oh, that's fine, really.

62
07:33.207 --> 07:36.007
In that case, why don't you do a quick sketch?

63
07:36.007 --> 07:38.206
I'll take a look at your fundamentals.

64
07:43.520 --> 07:45.447
What's wrong? Is it hard for you to do it?

65
07:45.447 --> 07:47.166
Well...

66
07:47.166 --> 07:49.560
I injured my hand a while ago.

67
07:49.560 --> 07:51.447
Oh, it's okay.

68
07:51.447 --> 07:52.726
Just a simple sketch will do.

69
07:52.726 --> 07:54.360
I just need to see the basics.

70
07:54.360 --> 07:56.527
We only teach kids here.

71
07:56.527 --> 07:58.807
As long as you're decent, it's fine.

72
08:15.000 --> 08:17.591
Shen Mo, what's going on?

73
08:19.967 --> 08:21.720
Since I injured my hand,

74
08:21.720 --> 08:24.046
I haven't been able to hold a pen.

75
08:24.046 --> 08:28.007
You can't hold it at all?

76
08:28.007 --> 08:29.647
I've tried many times.

77
08:29.647 --> 08:31.286
It's not working.

78
08:32.766 --> 08:34.246
How long until it heals?

79
08:34.246 --> 08:35.526
I don't know.

80
08:35.526 --> 08:37.526
Oh dear.

81
08:37.526 --> 08:39.407
Then there's nothing I can do.

82
08:39.407 --> 08:41.207
If you can't draw,

83
08:41.207 --> 08:43.640
I can't hire you even if I want to.

84
08:43.640 --> 08:44.807
Sir, please don't worry.

85
08:44.807 --> 08:48.047
I have the training and ability for this.

86
08:48.047 --> 08:49.927
Whether you want me to teach or draw...

87
08:49.927 --> 08:50.967
I can teach anything.

88
08:50.967 --> 08:52.967
I can do anything.

89
08:52.967 --> 08:54.207
I believe in your professional skills.

90
08:54.207 --> 08:55.807
I believe in your teaching ability, too.

91
08:55.807 --> 08:57.207
But you can't draw right now.

92
08:57.207 --> 08:59.407
What if the kids need a demonstration?

93
08:59.407 --> 09:01.967
I can't tell the kids that their teacher can't draw.

94
09:01.967 --> 09:03.926
That just wouldn't work.

95
09:05.366 --> 09:07.407
I've already sent out many resumes.

96
09:07.407 --> 09:08.687
Please, sir.

97
09:08.687 --> 09:09.687
I'm really sorry.

98
09:09.687 --> 09:10.846
There's nothing I can do.

99
09:10.846 --> 09:13.287
You should get your hand treated first.

100
09:13.287 --> 09:14.567
How about this?

101
09:14.567 --> 09:17.406
Call me when your hand gets better.

102
09:19.520 --> 09:20.726
Okay.

103
09:20.726 --> 09:22.406
Thank you, sir.

104
09:38.336 --> 09:46.247
[Urgent Recruitment: Library Staff, Book Organization]

105
10:03.120 --> 10:04.700
Shen Mo!

106
10:08.567 --> 10:10.166
Shen Mo!

107
10:23.800 --> 10:26.040
Mr. Ji, we found him.

108
10:26.040 --> 10:27.639
Good.

109
10:34.006 --> 10:35.407
Xiao Shen.

110
10:35.407 --> 10:36.886
Work faster.

111
10:36.886 --> 10:38.806
You're young, after all.

112
10:39.920 --> 10:42.326
Yes, sir. I understand.

113
11:04.560 --> 11:06.161
Shen Mo.

114
11:22.486 --> 11:24.406
What are you doing here?

115
11:26.327 --> 11:28.480
I got a job as a book organizer in the library.

116
11:28.480 --> 11:30.200
It's my first day of trial work.

117
11:30.200 --> 11:32.366
Why didn't you tell me you were going out?

118
11:32.366 --> 11:34.366
Huh?

119
11:34.366 --> 11:36.246
You didn't think I disappeared, did you?

120
11:36.246 --> 11:38.166
You've been looking for me?

121
11:39.493 --> 11:41.646
You haven't recovered yet.

122
11:41.646 --> 11:44.126
What if something happened while you were out?

123
11:44.126 --> 11:45.600
Oh, come on.

124
11:45.600 --> 11:46.967
I'm fine.

125
11:46.967 --> 11:49.686
How could I ever bear to leave you?

126
11:53.080 --> 11:55.199
Why did you want to do this?

127
11:56.486 --> 11:58.080
I just wanted to...

128
11:58.080 --> 12:00.679
help out with the household expenses.

129
12:10.840 --> 12:12.167
Dummy.

130
12:12.167 --> 12:14.487
We don't need you to do this.

131
12:15.440 --> 12:17.600
Does this go here?

132
12:17.600 --> 12:19.400
Oh, yes.

133
12:20.040 --> 12:22.840
These... These are all my tasks.

134
12:22.840 --> 12:24.726
I can do it myself.

135
12:24.726 --> 12:27.087
My boss is watching.

136
12:28.246 --> 12:29.486
Let me do it.

137
12:29.486 --> 12:31.286
Go home and wait for me.

138
12:32.167 --> 12:34.366
- Okay. - Don't worry.

139
12:34.366 --> 12:35.686
Okay.

140
12:42.242 --> 12:44.103
- Bye-bye. - Bye.

141
12:55.839 --> 12:57.880
You're off work early today.

142
12:59.006 --> 13:00.600
How was it?

143
13:00.600 --> 13:02.486
Was work tiring today?

144
13:02.486 --> 13:04.166
It was okay.

145
13:07.272 --> 13:09.832
You don't have to work this weekend, right?

146
13:11.087 --> 13:13.367
No. Why?

147
13:15.166 --> 13:17.320
Do you want to go to an art exhibition this weekend?

148
13:17.320 --> 13:18.967
A friend of mine just gave me two tickets.

149
13:18.967 --> 13:20.607
Wow!

150
13:24.440 --> 13:26.287
Did your friend really give them to you?

151
13:26.287 --> 13:28.600
Or did you know I wanted to go

152
13:28.600 --> 13:30.760
and specifically asked for them?

153
13:33.327 --> 13:35.446
Just tell me if you're going or not.

154
13:37.246 --> 13:39.006
I'll go!

155
13:39.006 --> 13:42.487
As long as I'm with you, I'll go anywhere.

156
14:13.207 --> 14:14.507
Look at this.

157
14:15.846 --> 14:16.967
Wow.

158
14:16.967 --> 14:18.886
Look at the paintings by those masters.

159
14:18.886 --> 14:20.806
They're really incredible.

160
14:21.680 --> 14:23.606
I've seen your work.

161
14:23.606 --> 14:25.006
You paint very well, too.

162
14:25.006 --> 14:27.487
How can I compare to them?

163
14:28.600 --> 14:31.806
You should quit your job at the library.

164
14:32.447 --> 14:34.046
Why?

165
14:36.200 --> 14:39.440
Have you ever seen a master working in a library?

166
14:40.687 --> 14:43.566
Suffering can be a breeding ground for creativity.

167
14:45.720 --> 14:48.001
I won't let you suffer again.

168
14:51.705 --> 14:55.705
Once your hand is healed, keep painting.

169
14:55.705 --> 14:57.946
Until you're better than all of them.

170
15:04.080 --> 15:08.399
When I become a great painter and start making money,

171
15:08.399 --> 15:10.439
I'll buy you that big house over there.

172
15:10.439 --> 15:11.780
Okay.

173
15:12.960 --> 15:15.519
I'll hold my exhibition here then.

174
15:15.519 --> 15:17.719
And you can wait for me at home.

175
15:19.240 --> 15:20.759
Okay.

176
15:20.759 --> 15:22.520
I'll wait for you to come home.

177
15:27.040 --> 15:28.760
All contract documents for this batch

178
15:28.760 --> 15:31.480
strictly follow the Group's three-level audit process.

179
15:31.480 --> 15:33.732
First, the head of the Business Department conducts a preliminary review

180
15:33.732 --> 15:36.080
to verify data and project feasibility.

181
15:36.080 --> 15:38.639
Then, the deputy general manager reviews and confirms it

182
15:38.639 --> 15:41.307
to manage project and financial risks.

183
15:41.307 --> 15:42.600
Finally, the Legal Department

184
15:42.600 --> 15:46.799
and Risk Management Department perform a compliance check for...

185
15:48.440 --> 15:49.840
Mr. Ji?

186
15:49.840 --> 15:53.959
Is there something wrong with my proposal?

187
15:55.345 --> 15:56.465
No, not at all.

188
15:56.465 --> 15:57.985
Let's proceed with your proposal.

189
15:57.985 --> 15:59.586
Meeting adjourned.

190
16:03.560 --> 16:05.825
Mr. Ji, I was just about to get your signature.

191
16:05.825 --> 16:07.666
I'm busy. Another day.

192
16:07.666 --> 16:09.225
I'm going to the hospital.

193
16:09.225 --> 16:11.266
Oh? Are you sick?

194
16:11.266 --> 16:12.465
I'm not sick.

195
16:12.465 --> 16:14.106
I'm visiting a patient.

196
16:24.880 --> 16:26.800
I've never seen Mr. Ji like this.

197
16:26.800 --> 16:28.546
Yeah.

198
16:28.546 --> 16:30.880
It feels like he's in love.

199
16:30.880 --> 16:33.146
Don't worry about that.

200
16:33.146 --> 16:36.026
I've contacted the best hospital and specialists here.

201
16:36.026 --> 16:37.945
This hand recovery surgery of yours...

202
16:37.945 --> 16:39.745
will definitely be fine.

203
16:47.026 --> 16:48.625
Yeah.

204
16:54.985 --> 16:57.625
What if it can't be healed?

205
16:58.638 --> 16:59.959
What if the surgery fails...

206
16:59.959 --> 17:02.386
and it gets even worse?

207
17:02.386 --> 17:03.666
Don't be afraid.

208
17:03.666 --> 17:06.026
It will definitely be fine.

209
17:06.026 --> 17:10.400
No matter what happens, I'll be by your side.

210
17:14.786 --> 17:15.905
I was just kidding.

211
17:15.905 --> 17:18.066
I'm not afraid.

212
17:18.066 --> 17:19.905
It's great if it's healed,

213
17:19.905 --> 17:22.185
but it's no big deal if it fails.

214
17:22.825 --> 17:25.528
Besides, as long as you're by my side,

215
17:25.528 --> 17:27.449
I'm not afraid of anything.

216
17:28.506 --> 17:30.585
Sometimes, I really can't figure you out.

217
17:30.585 --> 17:32.066
Huh?

218
17:33.280 --> 17:36.120
You're so mild, anyone could bully you.

219
17:37.145 --> 17:39.560
But once you get stubborn,

220
17:39.560 --> 17:41.560
you're stubborn as a mule.

221
17:43.233 --> 17:45.912
Is that a compliment or an insult?

222
17:47.592 --> 17:51.392
- What do you think? - All right, don't be too nervous.

223
17:51.392 --> 17:55.080
The surgery will be over by this time tomorrow.

224
17:55.080 --> 17:56.681
It's nothing.

225
17:57.993 --> 18:00.713
I just don't like hospitals much.

226
18:01.753 --> 18:03.352
My mother...

227
18:03.352 --> 18:04.952
Yeah?

228
18:05.713 --> 18:08.200
Let's talk about that later.

229
18:08.200 --> 18:11.059
Get some rest today.

230
18:11.059 --> 18:13.179
The surgery is tomorrow.

231
18:19.310 --> 18:20.999
[Operation]

232
18:49.233 --> 18:50.872
Doctor, how is he?

233
18:50.872 --> 18:52.792
Was the surgery successful?

234
18:52.792 --> 18:54.473
It was very successful.

235
19:01.560 --> 19:03.160
Hang in there.

236
19:07.233 --> 19:08.912
The surgery was a success.

237
19:09.792 --> 19:12.073
You'll be discharged soon.

238
19:12.973 --> 19:15.614
I thought about it before the anesthesia.

239
19:15.614 --> 19:18.013
If the surgery had failed,

240
19:18.013 --> 19:20.414
I would've just let you be my right hand.

241
19:20.414 --> 19:22.680
Don't talk like that.

242
19:22.680 --> 19:25.120
Once you're discharged,

243
19:25.120 --> 19:27.280
I'll take you out for a great meal.

244
19:27.280 --> 19:28.573
Okay.

245
19:28.573 --> 19:30.280
Wow, so many dishes!

246
19:30.280 --> 19:32.360
They all look delicious.

247
19:32.360 --> 19:35.200
Of course. This is my favorite hidden gem.

248
19:35.200 --> 19:38.359
I don't usually bring people here.

249
19:38.359 --> 19:39.960
It's such a nice place.

250
19:39.960 --> 19:42.000
Who have you been bringing here?

251
19:42.000 --> 19:43.092
Zhou Yang, Zhou Yang...

252
19:43.092 --> 19:45.480
You'd better be honest with me.

253
19:45.480 --> 19:47.480
I have something to discuss with you.

254
19:48.240 --> 19:50.119
From today on, you'll live with me.

255
19:50.119 --> 19:51.160
I've already found a place.

256
19:51.160 --> 19:52.519
Why?

257
19:52.519 --> 19:55.400
Isn't our current home fine?

258
19:55.400 --> 19:57.960
You'll like our new home even more.

259
20:11.119 --> 20:13.559
Where exactly is our new home?

260
20:24.000 --> 20:25.400
Here?

261
20:25.400 --> 20:26.640
Isn't this...

262
20:26.640 --> 20:28.039
Yes.

263
20:28.039 --> 20:31.240
To help you become a great artist sooner,

264
20:31.920 --> 20:35.000
we should live closer to the art gallery.

265
20:35.000 --> 20:38.119
But... this must be so expensive.

266
20:38.119 --> 20:39.960
It's such a high-end neighborhood.

267
20:39.960 --> 20:44.720
And didn't we say that I was going to give the house?

268
20:44.720 --> 20:47.000
Think of it as an investment.

269
20:47.000 --> 20:49.399
You're a future master artist.

270
20:51.640 --> 20:52.799
All right.

271
20:52.799 --> 20:56.559
Then for my comeback piece as the great artist Shen,

272
20:56.559 --> 20:59.880
I'll paint you first, okay?

273
20:59.880 --> 21:01.680
Or maybe a Ferris wheel.

274
21:01.680 --> 21:03.319
A Ferris wheel?

275
21:05.359 --> 21:06.880
Yeah.

276
21:06.880 --> 21:08.480
Near your old rental place,

277
21:08.480 --> 21:10.760
wasn't there a big Ferris wheel?

278
21:11.440 --> 21:14.720
That was where I managed to win you over.

279
21:31.359 --> 21:33.160
Don't move.

280
21:33.160 --> 21:34.960
Your hand hasn't fully healed yet.

281
21:38.440 --> 21:40.159
Thank you so much.

282
21:44.359 --> 21:46.399
Did you forget something?

283
21:47.592 --> 21:49.191
What?

284
21:49.880 --> 21:51.600
Give me your hand.

285
22:17.759 --> 22:19.359
Zhou Yang...

286
22:20.279 --> 22:23.119
Do you think my hand can heal?

287
22:23.839 --> 22:25.839
Of course.

288
22:25.839 --> 22:27.800
As long as you persevere,

289
22:28.760 --> 22:30.961
it will definitely pay off.

290
22:32.206 --> 22:33.925
I'm sure of it.

291
22:35.839 --> 22:37.640
Okay.

292
22:37.640 --> 22:40.079
When my hand is healed,

293
22:40.079 --> 22:43.200
I'm going to turn that empty, south-facing room

294
22:43.200 --> 22:44.440
into a studio.

295
22:44.440 --> 22:48.640
Then, I'll fill it with all my paintings.

296
22:48.640 --> 22:49.680
And that painting...

297
22:49.680 --> 22:51.519
The Ferris wheel will be right in the center.

298
22:51.519 --> 22:53.720
That way, you'll see it immediately.

299
22:57.519 --> 22:59.119
All right.

300
23:01.640 --> 23:04.839
I'll paint at home then.

301
23:04.839 --> 23:06.823
I'll cook for you at home,

302
23:06.823 --> 23:10.520
and I can sing for you.

303
23:10.520 --> 23:14.000
We can plan our trips together.

304
23:14.920 --> 23:17.359
And also...

305
25:00.280 --> 25:02.550
I must find a chance to devour you.

306
25:06.720 --> 25:08.480
Merry Christmas.

307
25:10.319 --> 25:11.960
During the New Year,

308
25:11.960 --> 25:14.280
I plan to go abroad to be with my family.

309
25:15.000 --> 25:16.355
Okay, that's great.

310
25:16.355 --> 25:18.915
I'll just wait for you to come back.

311
25:20.453 --> 25:21.894
What about you?

312
25:21.894 --> 25:25.334
Will you be home alone during the New Year?

313
25:25.334 --> 25:26.974
Or are you going back to your hometown?

314
25:27.773 --> 25:30.053
It's fine. I'll just go back to my hometown.

315
25:30.053 --> 25:31.974
Don't worry about me.

316
25:44.053 --> 25:45.974
Merry Christmas!

317
26:31.493 --> 26:33.654
I miss you.

318
26:36.440 --> 26:37.839
Stop it.

319
27:36.400 --> 27:38.020
Zhou Yang.

320
27:51.293 --> 27:53.174
I'm not Zhou Yang.

321
27:58.334 --> 28:00.654
You're the one I love most.

322
28:01.854 --> 28:03.813
How could I be mistaken?

323
28:14.213 --> 28:16.253
You're still not well.

324
28:17.600 --> 28:19.920
I'm not sick at all.

325
28:40.973 --> 28:43.333
We'll talk when you're better.

326
29:07.080 --> 29:08.414
Hello?

327
29:08.414 --> 29:10.120
What are you doing?

328
29:10.120 --> 29:11.960
I'm...

329
29:12.614 --> 29:14.733
I'm cleaning the house.

330
29:14.733 --> 29:16.958
Aren't you going back to your hometown?

331
29:16.958 --> 29:18.000
It's nearby.

332
29:18.000 --> 29:19.559
I'll leave after I finish cleaning.

333
29:19.559 --> 29:21.960
Oh, Zhou Yang, don't worry about me.

334
29:21.960 --> 29:24.920
Just enjoy your time with your family abroad.

335
29:24.920 --> 29:26.839
Okay.

336
29:26.839 --> 29:29.040
Remember to apply the medicine on your hand.

337
29:29.960 --> 29:31.559
Don't worry.

338
29:31.559 --> 29:33.840
Okay, bye.

339
29:39.799 --> 29:41.760
That was close.

340
29:56.760 --> 29:58.399
Are you asleep?

341
30:00.720 --> 30:02.160
Not yet.

342
30:02.160 --> 30:04.319
I'm waiting for midnight.

343
30:04.319 --> 30:05.359
What about you?

344
30:05.359 --> 30:07.200
I'm still having dinner.

345
30:09.200 --> 30:11.160
Oh, right.

346
30:11.160 --> 30:13.159
There's a time difference.

347
30:13.960 --> 30:16.400
Is celebrating New Year's abroad fun?

348
30:16.400 --> 30:18.079
It's not that interesting.

349
30:18.079 --> 30:19.360
Shen Mo.

350
30:19.360 --> 30:20.980
Where are you right now?

351
30:22.205 --> 30:24.086
I'm at home.

352
30:25.440 --> 30:26.879
Are you alone?

353
30:30.240 --> 30:31.720
I went back to my hometown.

354
30:31.720 --> 30:33.639
My parents are both here.

355
30:35.359 --> 30:36.659
Shen Mo.

356
30:38.799 --> 30:40.436
Happy New Year.

357
30:43.559 --> 30:45.440
Happy New Year.

358
31:01.079 --> 31:02.319
Zhou Yang.

359
31:02.319 --> 31:05.040
What are you doing right now?
